### **Git Issues**
```powershell
# Check remote URL
git remote -v

# Fix remote URL
git remote set-url origin https://github.com/pavanthakur/XYDataLabs.OrderProcessingSystem.git

# Resolve merge conflicts
git status                           # See conflicted files
